# Right Plant — project rules

## SCOPE
- Smallest diffs; no drive-by refactors or unrelated edits.
- No new `package.json` dependencies without explicit approval.
- No full rewrites of working modules.
- Read before write; match existing patterns.

## Correctness
- No `any` in TypeScript.
- No invented numbers, sources, or URLs in UI or copy.
- No silent fallbacks: failures show honest messages or "no data here".
- Async: AbortController for stale requests; debounce noisy inputs where specified.

## i18n
- User-visible strings use `t(lang, key)` for en, nl, fr, de.

## a11y
- Real `<button>` / labeled controls; keyboard focus visible; no div-only critical actions.

## Definition of done (each phase)
Before starting the next phase, all must pass:
- `npx tsc -b --noEmit`
- `npm run lint`
- `npm test`
- `npm run build`

Never report "done, but".
